# The compiled binary in the repository root.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash: without it the pattern matches at any depth,
# which also swallowed cmd/pixelgo-ops/ - the directory holding main.go - so
# the entry point was never committed and the repository did not build.
/pixelgo-ops
/pixelgo-ops.exe
dist/
*.qcow2
*.vhdx
